# A screw thread made through its screen on an extruded circle, its
# phase typed and its class chosen; the same model as
# path_thread_fit.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/thread_fit).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
